  "subdivision_of_building": "Front Elevation:\nRetain existing shopfront frames and grils above and re-spray, colour to match existing. Replace existing glass to shopfront with new laminated glass. New privacy manifestation to glazing and safety manifestation to doors applied internally. New 300mm Heritage non illuminated individual letters. New 55' Attractor panel (internal). Deep clean existing stone riser\nNew CCTV camera. New 710mm Barclays Eagle internally illuminated. New Automatic door entrance. New Push Panel to door. New Suspended kit signage (internal). Anti-graffiti coating to all shopfront. New aluminium composite panels in dark blue (RAL 5011 gloss finish) to replace existing glazing as shown on proposed elevations. \n\nSide Elevation: \nNew 655mm Heritage non illuminated projecting sign. New ATM white surround internally illuminated. New CCTV camera.  Anti-graffiti coating to all shopfront. Replace existing glass with new metal louver, colour to match existing. ",
